      "name": "Mathew Wahome",
      "created_at": "2025-10-15T04:53:13.496Z",
      "cooked": "<p>What I’m Trying to Achieve</p>\n<p>I want to control which workspaces users can see based on their assigned roles.<br>\nFor example:<br>\nEmployee role - Should ONLY see Employee Self Service workspace<br>\nReceptionist role - Should ONLY see Visitor Management workspace<br>\nHR Manager - Should see HR workspace<br>\nBut I have added the role restriction to the workspace and the user with the employee role is not able to see any workspace even the ones with no restriction.</p>",
