      "created_at": "2025-10-15T05:24:46.553Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hi <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/mathew\">@mathew</a></p>\n<p>There are two type of workspace controls.</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Private workspace can be created for a user only and will be visible within its workspace.</li>\n<li>Public workspaces are global and can be controlled by roles as following. You can create public workspace and define role who can have access to it knowing the fact all kind of doctypes, reports and pages are also requires to be defined under role permission manager too.</li>\n</ol>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/2/4/24288e96aad6148016bfdef943d7a52325e1ae69.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/24288e96aad6148016bfdef943d7a52325e1ae69\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/2/4/24288e96aad6148016bfdef943d7a52325e1ae69_2_690x364.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"59S54K3ACvs3hpmmnBZ5drr3VLH\" width=\"690\" height=\"364\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/2/4/24288e96aad6148016bfdef943d7a52325e1ae69_2_690x364.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/2/4/24288e96aad6148016bfdef943d7a52325e1ae69_2_1035x546.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/2/4/24288e96aad6148016bfdef943d7a52325e1ae69_2_1380x728.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"F7F7F8\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1834×968 84.7 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>",
